    {
      "title": "Elastic distribution",
      "layout": [
        {
          "type": "notes",
          "cfg": {
            "title": "Step 4 \u2013 springs + ARB distribution",
            "text": "Now match the **elastic** path to the geometry chosen above so the total LLTD lands in the band and the roll gradient is met.\n\n- Pinned: front/rear roll-stiffness targets and ARB shares (adaptive mode solves the spring rates).\n- Run the **optimiser**: it uses the pinned sliders as variables (their min/max are the bounds) and the Targets as the objective.\n- Apply the best result, then check it on the value tiles."
          },
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 6
        },
