          "cfg": {
            "title": "Step 6 \u2013 the inertial delay",
            "text": "The first ~100 ms of a corner: geometric LT is instant, the elastic path needs roll, and the dampers carry most of the elastic part meanwhile (OptimumG \u2018Entry requirements\u2019).\n\n- Use road presets (sidebar \u2192 Transient input) for a **slow hairpin** and a **fast sweeper**.\n- Tune low-speed bump/rebound (pinned) and watch the % shares and overshoot.\n- Target: high geometric share at t0+50 ms, small overshoot."
          },
